// 16th strumming: down on every beat and "&", up on every "e" and "a"; the "e" of 1 and 3 is missed.
// Beats 2 and 4 are accented (the backbeat); every other strum is light, a ghost of the accent.
\title "16th groove on Em, C, G, D"
\tempo 90
\track ("Guitar" "Gtr.") { instrument acousticguitarsteel }
